Traveller: Morning. I''d like a ticket to the seaside town of Brighton, please.
Clerk: Of course. The next train leaves at half past nine from platform two.
Traveller: How long does the journey take?
Clerk: About one hour. It follows a route along the coast, so the views are lovely.
Traveller: That sounds nice. How much is a single ticket?
Clerk: A single is fifteen pounds, but a day return is only eighteen.
Traveller: I''ll take the day return, then. Here''s twenty pounds.
Clerk: Thank you. Here''s your ticket and your change. Have a good trip!', '旅客想买一张去海滨小镇布莱顿的票;下趟车九点半从二号站台发车;车程约一小时,沿海岸线行驶,风景很美;单程票15英镑,当日往返票18英镑;旅客买了往返票,付了20英镑。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"Where does the traveller want to go?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["To a seaside town called Brighton.","To a quiet mountain village.","To the capital city.","To a small island."]},{"q":"When does the next train leave?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["At eight o''clock.","At half past nine.","At a quarter past ten.","At noon."]},{"q":"How long does the journey take?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["About one hour.","About three hours.","Half a day.","Only ten minutes."]},{"q":"Why are the views so lovely?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["The train goes through a city.","The train runs along the coast.","The train climbs a high mountain.","The train crosses a desert."]},{"q":"Which ticket does the traveller buy?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["A single ticket.","A weekly pass.","A day return.","A first-class ticket."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required2', 'U5', 'fltrp');
Ben: Not yet. I''d love to get out of the city, though.
Anna: Why don''t we go hiking near the lake? The scenery there is amazing.
Ben: Great idea! How do we get there?
Anna: We can take the early bus on Saturday. It''s cheaper than driving.
Ben: Perfect. Should we book a room for the night?
Anna: Yes, there''s a small hotel by the lake. I''ll book it online tonight.
Ben: And I''ll bring my camera. I want some photos of the sunset.
Anna: Don''t forget warm clothes. It gets cold near the water in the evening.', 'Anna 问 Ben 长周末有没有计划;Ben 想离开城市;Anna 建议去湖边徒步,那里风景很美;周六坐早班公交去,比开车便宜;湖边有家小旅馆,Anna 今晚在线预订;Ben 带相机想拍日落;Anna 提醒带暖和的衣服,因为傍晚水边很冷。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What does Ben want to do this weekend?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Get out of the city.","Stay at home and rest.","Visit a busy shopping mall.","Work on a school project."]},{"q":"What does Anna suggest?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Flying to another country.","Going hiking near the lake.","Driving across the mountains.","Taking a boat to an island."]},{"q":"How will they travel there?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["By their own car.","By a slow train.","By the early bus.","On foot all the way."]},{"q":"Who will book the hotel room?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Ben.","Ben''s brother.","The bus driver.","Anna."]},{"q":"Why should they take warm clothes?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["It gets cold by the water at night.","It often snows in summer there.","The hotel has no heating.","The bus is always very cold."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required2', 'U5', 'fltrp');
